l/projtui already\nimports internal/proj, and the moved main.go imports internal/projtui —\nmerging would have created an import cycle. It lives in the new\ninternal/projcli package instead, importing both internal/proj and\ninternal/projtui as before. creel had no such conflict and folds\ndirectly into its existing internal/creel package.\n\nPure move + repackage: Dispatch preserves run()'s exact exit-code\nsemantics and stdout/stderr routing at the dispatch level; command Run\ninternals, the bare-project/picker routes, and cmd/scratch (still\npackage main) are untouched. Verified byte-identical CLI behavior\n(help/version/commands/man/list/current/new/bogus flags/status-file)\nagainst the pre-refactor binaries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018vSG7H8mstdLQHHBRJmfav","timestamp":"2026-09-05T03:04:51Z","author":{"name":"Court Schuett","email":"court@subaud.io"},"committer":{"name":"Court Schuett","email":"court@subaud.io"}},"repository":{"id":1300559398,"node_id":"R_kgDOTYT2Jg","name":"tackle","full_name":"schuettc/tackle","private":false,"owner":{"login":"schuettc","id":71404236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDA0MjM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71404236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc","html_url":"https://github.com/schuettc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/rec